' S-611: the methods of an INTERFACE own their parameters too (same name `v`, types I32 and F64); WASM prints no floats.
INTERFACE IX
    METHOD A(v AS I32) AS I32
    METHOD B(v AS F64) AS F64
END INTERFACE
CLASS K IMPLEMENTS IX
    PUBLIC
    METHOD A(v AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN v + 1
    END METHOD
    METHOD B(v AS F64) AS F64
        RETURN v + 0.5
    END METHOD
END CLASS
DIM kk AS K = NEW K()
PRINT kk.A(4)
PRINT kk.B(1.0)
